6.8 Private candidates
This specification is not available to private candidates.

6.9 Use of calculators
Students may use a calculator in the examination. They must however ensure that their calculator
meets the requirements as set out in the JCQ Instructions for conducting examinations. These
instructions make it clear what the requirements are for calculators (what they must be) and what
they are not (what they must not be). The instructions are regularly updated and can be found on
the Joint Council for Qualifications website at www.jcq.org.uk.

